      "updated": 1766592966515,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n2) Functional Requirements:  \n- user inputs pickup & Drop location to get fare estimation\n- User requests a Ride\n- ride request matching with available drivers nearby\n- Driver can accept/reject ride request\n\n--- Out of Scope -------\n- Different types of vehicles\n- payment part\n- rating of passanger/driver\n- chat/calling feature\n- advance scheduling of rides.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n2) Functional Requirements:  \n- user inputs pickup & Drop location to get fare estimation\n- User requests a Ride\n- ride request matching with available drivers nearby\n- Driver can accept/reject ride request\n\n--- Out of Scope -------\n- Different types of vehicles\n- payment part\n- rating of passanger/driver\n- chat/calling feature\n- advance scheduling of rides.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b3QeLqnLHsxkexeN17H12",
