    {
      "id": "Y3jegDnt_wNByJWdgpEyA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540.161264110989,
      "y": 1052.230046264057,
      "width": 770.9084738017215,
      "height": 278.76115173601306,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 526339248,
      "version": 9631,
      "versionNonce": 548056867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766595254915,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Notification service: Responsible for dispatching real-time notifications to\ndrivers when a new ride request is matched to them. It ensures that drivers\nare promptly informed so they can accept ride requests in a timely manner,\nthus maintaining a fluid user experience. Notifications are sent via APN\n(Apple Push Notification) and FCM (Firebase Cloud Messaging) for IOS and\nAndroid devices, respectively.\n\n2) Postgres supports a plugin called PostGIS that allows us to use\ngeospatial data types + index.\n\n3) geo hashing vs geo indexing: -- Refer Interview notes. ",
      "fontSize": 20.273538308073675,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Notification service: Responsible for dispatching real-time notifications to drivers when a new ride request is matched to them. It ensures that drivers are promptly informed so they can accept ride requests in a timely manner, thus maintaining a fluid user experience. Notifications are sent via APN (Apple Push Notification) and FCM (Firebase Cloud Messaging) for IOS and Android devices, respectively.\n\n2) Postgres supports a plugin called PostGIS that allows us to use geospatial data types + index.\n\n3) geo hashing vs geo indexing: -- Refer Interview notes. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
