      "seed": 1423259250,
      "version": 3228,
      "versionNonce": 1049687331,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766593588769,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability : Data to be provided by the interviewer\n- Low Latency in terms of request matching(<1min), fetching estimated\nfare(near real time)\n- Throughput: High throughput interms of the ride requests\n- Consistency: Highly consistent interms of the ride request matching. 1\nRider - 1 Driver\n- Availability: High availability overall apart from above.\n\n--- Out of scope---------\n- privacy & security of user and drivers data\n- The system should be resilient to failures, with redundancy and failover\nmechanisms in place.\n\n4) Core Entities \n- Rider\n- Driver\n- Ride\n- Location\n- Fare",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability : Data to be provided by the interviewer\n- Low Latency in terms of request matching(<1min), fetching estimated fare(near real time)\n- Throughput: High throughput interms of the ride requests\n- Consistency: Highly consistent interms of the ride request matching. 1 Rider - 1 Driver\n- Availability: High availability overall apart from above.\n\n--- Out of scope---------\n- privacy & security of user and drivers data\n- The system should be resilient to failures, with redundancy and failover mechanisms in place.\n\n4) Core Entities \n- Rider\n- Driver\n- Ride\n- Location\n- Fare",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A2P4AILlBEj0BXizHjARR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 742.1653106455716,
      "y": 940.4175295359078,
      "width": 725.6259140844274,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 408070254,
      "version": 2178,
      "versionNonce": 949169955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766593136233,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5) API Design \n\nPOST/ride/fare \n    Input: {pickup, drop location} \n    Output: 2xx, {Fare}\n\nPOST/ride -> Async Operation for requesting ride \n    Input: {fareId} \n    Ouput: 2xx, {ride}\n\nPOST/driver/location -> updates near real time driver location \n    Input: {location} \n    Output: 2xx\n\nPOST/driver/ride -> accepting/ rejecting ride \n    Input: {action: true|false} \n    Output: {pickuplocation | null}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) API Design \n\nPOST/ride/fare \n    Input: {pickup, drop location} \n    Output: 2xx, {Fare}\n\nPOST/ride -> Async Operation for requesting ride \n    Input: {fareId} \n    Ouput: 2xx, {ride}\n\nPOST/driver/location -> updates near real time driver location \n    Input: {location} \n    Output: 2xx\n\nPOST/driver/ride -> accepting/ rejecting ride \n    Input: {action: true|false} \n    Output: {pickuplocation | null}\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Km1NZVmnIh-ujNqLOcpVA",
      "type": "text",
